# Harbor inventory

List projects, repositories, artifacts/tags, and scan summaries. Prefer MCP
when connected (`global-mcp-first`); else Harbor API or authenticated UI.

Never invent project / repo / artifact digests — list/resolve first. Resolve
the Harbor base URL from operator config. Report project + repo + tag/digest —
never paste robot tokens or admin passwords.
